t explore real-world topics. Many parents love reading the books together with their kids, helping spark great conversations and making learning a family experience.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="30573964-4d84-4af7-a66f-54b60b772af9" class="r-1n2vnsq" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="08b9ba6a-f399-4333-9030-e3b461418786" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R57j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1xigwzo"><div data-rid="a4dac4c0-1c28-4292-b8de-3c22e2d63fc9" class="r-h2c5hx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What kinds of concepts do the books teach?</p></span></div><div data-rid="8be433a7-45db-432f-97b6-5c2eb22144db" class="r-1nolv5y" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-oyx88e" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R57j2:"><div data-rid="07238e52-5068-4959-9b4c-4c9516de5ef6" class="r-u4jpj6"><div data-rid="9ad97dfe-4656-4ff0-823a-4bfa719abad3" class="r-s7i1om alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>These stories introduce kids to freedom-based ideas like individual liberty, free-market economics, personal responsibility, critical thinking, entrepreneurship, and real-world history—wrapped up in fun, age-appropriate adventures.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="504178e3-48a8-4335-8f64-21fbbca946b6" class="r-qpbapg" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="2f913a53-eb7a-4b3a-8ae2-f201ede549d2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R77j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-tvab13"><div data-rid="91c639c0-d802-4571-a6a4-7d931cf